        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "在下方，栋梁的弯曲得以平复，吉祥；要是九四爻，爻辞说‘栋隆，吉①；有它，吝②。’",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
